{"kind":"doc","route":"/guide/style/testing","title":"Testing what you built","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"testing-what-you-built","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Testing what you built"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The matrix says what the states are. This page is how you look at them."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"drivers","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Drivers"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Every axis point carries the driver that reaches it. An axis without one would"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"be worse than a missing axis: the matrix would enumerate scenarios nothing can"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"produce and render identical captures — false coverage rather than none."}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { applyScenario, visualMatrix } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/style-testing'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"for","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" (","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"scenario"},{"text":" "},{"text":"of","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"visualMatrix","kind":"function"},{"text":"(card)) {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"await","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"applyScenario","kind":"function"},{"text":"(page, scenario);","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"await","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"expect","kind":"function"},{"text":"(page).","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"toHaveScreenshot","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"`${","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"scenario","kind":"string"},{"text":".","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"id","kind":"string"},{"text":"}.png`","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"}","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"page"},{"t":"text","text":" is described structurally, so Playwright is not a dependency — a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"Playwright "},{"t":"code","text":"Page"},{"t":"text","text":" matches the shape and is passed unchanged."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Application order is fixed in one place ("},{"t":"code","text":"orderedDrivers"},{"t":"text","text":"): emulation and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"viewport first because they relayout, container width next, DOM state after,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"scrolling last. Applying them in declaration order instead would make a capture"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"depend on which axis someone wrote first."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"exhaustiveness","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Exhaustiveness"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  assertExhaustiveVisualMatrix,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  baselinesIn,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  visualMatrix,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"} ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/style-testing'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"assertExhaustiveVisualMatrix","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"visualMatrix","kind":"function"},{"text":"(card), ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"baselinesIn","kind":"function"},{"text":"(files));","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"It fails in "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"both"}]},{"t":"text","text":" directions. A baseline nothing produces any more matters as"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"much as a missing one: it is a state the component used to have, and whoever"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"opens the folder still counts it as covered."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The check is post-inference on purpose. A self-referential constraint on the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"component's own declaration resolves the union to "},{"t":"code","text":"never"},{"t":"text","text":" and passes while"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"checking nothing — the same shape as "},{"t":"code","text":"assertExhaustiveRouteExceptions"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"content-cases","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Content cases"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The matrix covers "},{"t":"em","children":[{"t":"text","text":"conditions"}]},{"t":"text","text":", not "},{"t":"em","children":[{"t":"text","text":"data"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — and the eighty-character title, the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"empty list and the seven-figure price are what break layouts most often. No type"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"can derive them, so they are declared:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { contentCases, visualMatrix } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/style-testing'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"contentCases","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"visualMatrix","kind":"function"},{"text":"(card), { longTitle: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'x'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":".","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"repeat","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"80","kind":"number"},{"text":"), empty: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"''","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":" });","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A data case is rendered at one point of each axis, except on the axes that change"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the space available — viewport and container — where the crossing is complete. A"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"long title behaves differently at two widths; it does not behave differently in"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"two colour schemes."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"what-the-graph-adds","children":[{"t":"text","text":"What the graph adds"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The style dump joins the dependency graph, so the questions that cross layers"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"have answers. "},{"t":"code","text":"graph"},{"t":"text","text":" is the dependency graph the dev tools build; the dump half"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"of it is what "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/style/setup#what-the-plugin-produces","external":false,"children":[{"t":"code","text":"craftStyle({ dumpPath })"}]},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"writes, so these queries return nothing useful until that option is set."}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  danglingVars,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  impactedClasses,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  matrixSizeByComponent,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  unproven,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  varsWrittenBy,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"} ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/dev-tools'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"matrixSizeByComponent","kind":"function"},{"text":"(graph); ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// what a component costs to capture","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"impactedClasses","kind":"function"},{"text":"(graph, [","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'--ds-accent'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"]); ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// what one token change can be seen in","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"varsWrittenBy","kind":"function"},{"text":"(graph); ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// proves a colour axis only repaints","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"danglingVars","kind":"function"},{"text":"(graph); ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// declared and never read","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"unproven","kind":"function"},{"text":"(graph); ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// every escape hatch, with its reason","kind":"comment"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"impactedClasses"},{"t":"text","text":" is the one that pays for the visual CI: changing a colour"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"should recapture what reaches it, not the whole suite."}]},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"the-same-questions-from-an-agent","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The same questions, from an agent"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Three of these are exposed as MCP tools by "},{"t":"code","text":"@craft-ts/mcp"},{"t":"text","text":", so an agent can ask"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"them without writing a script:"}]},{"t":"table","head":[[{"t":"text","text":"MCP tool"}],[{"t":"text","text":"answers"}]],"rows":[[[{"t":"code","text":"style_impact"}],[{"t":"text","text":"which classes and components one token or variable change is visible in"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"style_matrix"}],[{"t":"text","text":"how many scenarios each component costs to capture"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"style_debt"}],[{"t":"text","text":"every escape hatch — "},{"t":"code","text":"unsafeLength"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"unsafeAssume"},{"t":"text","text":" — with its reason"}]]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"They read the same dump. A "},{"t":"code","text":"style_matrix"},{"t":"text","text":" that answers with nothing is the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"signature of a missing "},{"t":"code","text":"dumpPath"},{"t":"text","text":", and the server says so."}]}],"outline":[{"level":2,"id":"drivers","text":"Drivers"},{"level":2,"id":"exhaustiveness","text":"Exhaustiveness"},{"level":2,"id":"content-cases","text":"Content cases"},{"level":2,"id":"what-the-graph-adds","text":"What the graph adds"},{"level":3,"id":"the-same-questions-from-an-agent","text":"The same questions, from an agent"}]}